Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《福音战士新剧场版：序》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偏偏在这时候出现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于现在发布了特别非常事态公告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有线路不通
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:27.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手机也还处于圈外状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴士和电车也都停运了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是无法碰面了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.18,0:01:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.18,0:01:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.18,0:01:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了  到避难中心去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标全弹命中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标依然健在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前依然向着第三新东京市前进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航空队的战斗力无法阻止它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投入所有战力  后方的第四师团也全部投入进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好吝惜的  无论如何也要摧毁目标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  不是直接命中了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战车大队全灭  诱导兵器和炮击都完全没有效果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  这种程度的火力根本不够看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是A.T.力场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  对使徒来说常规根本毫无作用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了  按照预定计划发动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:04:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  难道…要使用N2地雷！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真遗憾  看来没有你们登场的机会了  - 冲击波过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  不过嘴里全是沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么…要开始推了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  帮了个大忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里  该道谢的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛城小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我美里就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次请多多关照了  碇真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:04:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在目标如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那种爆炸之下  胜负已分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的王牌都…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好雷诺还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有12次按揭没付清呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子就这么报废掉的话也太讽刺了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直达特快列车也已经安排好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能按时到达吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不问么  真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从头到尾都是我一个人讲个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒也不用道歉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一般不是都会问“刚刚那大家伙是什么东西”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“发生什么事了”之类的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想即使问了也不会回答我的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真是爱妄自断言啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.91,0:06:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不像个孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无所谓  我不过是遵从老师的教诲罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚那是被称作使徒的谜之生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四使徒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惊人的自我复原能力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:34.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单独且完全的准完美生物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这能力是当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吞食了生命之果的生物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了毁灭偷食智慧之果的我们的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闸门关闭  请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特务机关NERV？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  联合国直属的非公开组织
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是爸爸所在的组织对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧  知道你父亲是做什么的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听老师说  是保护人类的重要工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始本次作战的指挥权就移交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们见识一下你的本事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇君  我承认我们现有的兵器对目标无效
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你能打赢是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,NERV就是为此而成立的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在要去父亲那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  正是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  对了  从你父亲那里拿到ID卡了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  先看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,NERV
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲的工作…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要我做些什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊  没事的话父亲是不会给我写信的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  你不擅长和爸爸相处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是地下空间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我们的秘密基地  NERV本部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重建世界的中枢  是人类的要塞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看  从车站西口出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北面三号大门往右
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入八号路线…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这设施还真是既复杂又乱来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是这条线路才对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说  是迷路了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不太熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  条条大路通罗马嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.46,0:09:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二冷却结束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操作人员请立刻退避
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左腕传动部的解冻作业 请在接下来的三分钟内完成
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了同时收集细胞坏死数据
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告赤木博士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认作战一课葛城二佐外加一人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到达S-36尺度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不像话  又迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  律子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比预定到达的时间晚了12分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为等太久了  所以直接过来接你们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛城二佐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不是人手不足我也没这个空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是那个少年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:45.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是技术局一课  E计划负责人  赤木律子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  接下来就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阔别三年的会面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副司令  目标再次开始移动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  全员第一种战斗配置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.49,0:10:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复一遍  全员第一种战斗配置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对地迎击战  准备
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇真嗣君  有东西想让你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人造的终极泛用人型决战兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人造人EVANGELION的初号机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们人类最后的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是父亲的工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:44.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出击
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出击！？零号机还在冻结中吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道要使用初号机？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:10:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别无选择了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由你来驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲…为什么要叫我来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你想的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  是我要驾驶这个和刚才的怪物战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事我才不干！为什么现在才说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲你不是已经不需要我了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在需要了所以叫你来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为别人办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能  见所未见闻所未闻的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我怎么操控啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按说明去做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能驾驶这种东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要驾驶的话就快点  要不然就——回去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐  发现这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一层  第八装甲板损坏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.19,0:12:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,D区各处发生火灾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指定区域内所有通道紧急封锁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:18.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  难得来到这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有这样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  你是为了什么而来这里的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃避  不能逃避你父亲  更不能逃避自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道！可是…根本不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把丽叫起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.53,0:12:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.37,0:12:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后备不能用了  再出击一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机的核心组模切换到L-00型号  重新启动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  当前作业中断  开始重新启动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动命令初始化
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我果然是没人要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标突破绝对防御线
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依然向正上方地点移动中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃避  不能逃避  不能逃避  不能逃避…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃避！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由我来驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三次冷却结束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惯性轮停止旋转  解除连接
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辅助电压没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止信号插头  排出完成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  插入栓  插入
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脊髓传导系统解除  连接准备
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探查针  插入完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入栓深度维持在20
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神污染测量值在基准范围内
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维持在+02到-05
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内核  固定完成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  第一次接触
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入栓  注水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  肺部充满LCL之后就能直接向血液提供氧气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会习惯的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主电源连接完成
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:19.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入第二次接触
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界面连接
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A10神经连接  没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LCL电化状态正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,思考形态调整到以日语为基础原则
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初期连接  无任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开交互回路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目录1405为止一切正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突触测量  同步率41.3%
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有战斗服的辅助呢  真惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谐波  全部值正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有出现暴走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一锁定栓解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解除确认
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母桥  开始移动
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二锁定栓解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一拘束具解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同样  第二拘束具解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:22.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1到15号安全装置解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解除确认
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在初号机为无制约状态
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内部电源  充电完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外部电源  连接无异常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  EVA初号机  移到射出口
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各加速轨道的变位没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电磁诱导系统运作正常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在初号机往K52移动中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射出顺序按预定进行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA  到达射出终端
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通道开启  一切畅通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出击准备完成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:16:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不打倒使徒  我们就没有未来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇  这样真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧  真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.32,0:17:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终安全装置解除！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVANGELION初号机  出击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只想着向前走就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.19,0:18:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  快点站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被抓住的不是你的手腕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA的防御系统呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号不工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力场没有展开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:48.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左腕损伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回路断线
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  躲开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头盖前部发生龟裂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装甲撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.02,0:19:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头部破损  损害不明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活动维持发生问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,状况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同步图像反转  脉冲逆流
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切断回路  止住逆流
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号被拒绝  无法接收
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屏幕无反应  生死不明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机  完全沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到此为止了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作战终止  优先保护驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强制射出插入栓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！  完全不受控制
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA  再次启动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.97,0:19:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会！？  应该不能动了才对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴走！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A.T.力场？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  只要A.T.力场还存在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就无法接触到使徒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左腕复原！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机也展开了A.T.力场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在中和相位空间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.14,0:20:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是在侵蚀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个A.T.力场  这么轻易地就给…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是EVA的…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的形态
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字  决定好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男孩的话就叫真嗣  女孩就叫丽
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣  丽
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣  真嗣  绫波  真嗣？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽  丽  碇  丽？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对  绫波丽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陌生的天花板
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.25,0:23:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四使徒的袭来及其歼灭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:23.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有第三适格者的接收
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.79,0:23:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及EVA初号机的初启动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大致跟预料的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机本体庞大的修理费倒是在预料之外
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与冻结的零号机相比根本算不上什么大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA初号机本体的回收工作已经完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在固定在第六格纳库
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.40,0:23:45.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预定今天10点开始检查
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴走时的记录呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.85,0:23:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容量为零  什么也没记下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.48,0:23:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果就是  原因不明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.23,0:23:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为兵器来说可靠性…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真有点严峻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然有点不尽人意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要在第五使徒出现时还能起作用就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.47,0:24:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心  初号机投入实战的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贰号机与配属的驾驶员也在德国进行实证评价试验
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.37,0:24:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叁号机以后的建造也在计划中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适当运用NERV和EVA是你的责任和义务
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.51,0:24:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不要让我们失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  歼灭使徒  不过是与莉莉丝契约的一小部分
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.65,0:24:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“人类补完计划”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.84,0:24:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的完成才是我们的终极目标
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.50,0:24:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.83,0:24:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照SEELE的剧本进行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.41,0:25:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去A.T.力场的使徒的崩坏  还真出乎意料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.79,0:25:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是一片血池地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉就像第二次冲击一样  感觉真不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA能够战胜使徒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅是这一事实  就能给人类留下一丝希望
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肩负着这一希望的驾驶员好像醒来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一内科的鹈饲医生  鹈饲医生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请立即与第一外科的东医生联系
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.31,0:25:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B事件的医疗会议按预定进行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参加者请到第二会议室集合
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.08,0:25:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.52,0:26:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  他的个室在这前边的第六区  没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.44,0:26:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样真的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  一个人比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.61,0:26:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在哪都是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.13,0:26:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.05,0:26:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说  把真嗣君领到我那去了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.06,0:26:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经取得上头的许可了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.02,0:26:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧  我是不会对小孩出手的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.14,0:26:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,废话！你都在想些什么啊  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.98,0:26:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这人总是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.19,0:26:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还是老样子  开不起玩笑的家伙 - 你唠叨什么我可听得一清二楚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.82,0:26:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.56,0:26:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  今晚非得大闹一场才行了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是新房客的欢迎会咯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.27,0:26:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是要搬走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  没想到这里真的变成战场了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.02,0:26:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊  我老公也让我和孩子先去避难
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天一天的搬迁申请好像就已经超过100件了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.41,0:27:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  即使是要塞都市  NERV还是一点都靠不住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.63,0:27:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的事件  想想都觉得可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.33,0:27:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.28,0:27:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  稍微绕点路
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要到哪里去？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.97,0:27:21.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  地  方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:31.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷清的城市啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.95,0:27:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.84,0:28:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大厦都升起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:32.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是专用于迎击使徒的要塞都市
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三新东京市
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.20,0:28:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的城市哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.14,0:28:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是…你所保卫的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.04,0:28:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想真嗣君的行李应该已经送到了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.41,0:28:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也是前几天刚刚搬来这座城市的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.92,0:28:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.87,0:29:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.95,0:29:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.33,0:29:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  这里是你自己的家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.82,0:29:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.71,0:29:24.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  虽然有点乱  别介意哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.29,0:29:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也叫…稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉  帮我把吃的放到冰箱里去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.02,0:29:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.34,0:29:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下酒菜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:39.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.86,0:29:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过的是什么生活啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.23,0:29:45.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.18,0:29:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈！ Cool！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.66,0:29:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然人就是为了这一刻而活的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.67,0:30:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不吃吗？挺好吃的哦  虽然是速食的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.11,0:30:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  只是  我还不习惯这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.03,0:30:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑食可不行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是的  只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很开心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样跟别人一块吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.61,0:30:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.38,0:30:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天开始这里就是你的家了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.17,0:30:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不用客气的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.85,0:30:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  “是是是是”的烦死啦  你是男孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.64,0:30:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我干脆点  干脆点啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.40,0:30:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.92,0:30:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  算了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.27,0:30:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去泡个澡吧  把不开心的事全部洗掉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.23,0:30:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泡澡可是生命的洗礼哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.17,0:31:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美  美  美  美  美里小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.75,0:31:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.51,0:31:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那  那  那  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.98,0:31:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.37,0:31:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  它啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.06,0:31:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是温泉企鹅  是种鸟类哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.02,0:31:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那种鸟的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.79,0:31:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十五年前的话倒是有很多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.76,0:31:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字叫盼盼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.16,0:31:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为某种缘分待在我家
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.76,0:31:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是家里的另一名房客
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.61,0:31:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来  前面  不遮一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.89,0:31:42.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩笑会不会开得太过了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.34,0:31:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被看透的说不定是我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛城美里小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.47,0:31:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.54,0:31:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泡澡可是生命的洗礼哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.01,0:31:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…泡澡更容易会让人想起不好的回忆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.98,0:32:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽的状况怎样了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.57,0:32:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午让她去医院了  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.41,0:32:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.75,0:32:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去准备冻结中的零号机的重新启动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您儿子没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.29,0:32:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他精神还很不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.17,0:32:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用管他  反而可以成为解除零号机冻结的好借口
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.34,0:32:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  就按照葛城二佐的建议办
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.23,0:32:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（真嗣的房间）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有预先通知  突然被选出来的第三适格者
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.47,0:32:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像与之呼应一样  使徒在这个时间来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.15,0:32:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再加上被强制接收的碇司令的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.36,0:32:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的事  确实有些不自然
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.27,0:32:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.49,0:32:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明将那个使徒打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.70,0:33:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我却意外的高兴不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.68,0:33:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也是陌生的天花板吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座城市里没有一件东西是我熟悉的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.90,0:33:16.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是你自己的家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么待在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  我开门咯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.68,0:33:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有句话  我忘记说了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了件值得夸奖的大事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.05,0:33:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该觉得骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.68,0:33:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.55,0:33:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思啊  转校生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.63,0:34:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要不揍你心里就不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.01,0:34:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉啊  他妹妹在上次的骚动中受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.30,0:34:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢  就是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.92,0:34:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是想驾驶才坐上去的…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪门子值得夸奖的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.88,0:34:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是被叫去驾驶EVA而已  为什么要被揍
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.89,0:34:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.11,0:34:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.10,0:34:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使徒身上一定有个被称为核心的部位
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.38,0:35:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将其破坏是从物理上歼灭使徒的唯一手段
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.48,0:35:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以瞄准它  把准心对准目标  扣下扳机
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.73,0:35:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样好好处理  抓住这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.81,0:35:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.01,0:35:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.26,0:35:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样  继续诱导模式的练习
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.78,0:35:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.13,0:35:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没想到真嗣君会愿意驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.53,0:35:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“老老实实的听从别人的指示”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.99,0:35:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那孩子的处世之道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.44,0:35:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把准心对准目标  扣下扳机
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.17,0:35:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把准心对准目标  扣下扳机
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.57,0:35:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把准心对准目标  扣下扳机
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把准心对准目标  扣下扳机…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.82,0:36:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来真嗣君好像转校第一天就被同学揍了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.45,0:36:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶员的安全保障  没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.90,0:36:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谍报部的监视系统没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.75,0:36:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是什么重伤
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且个人隐私还是尽量不要去干涉的好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.85,0:36:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是住在一起吗  照顾他也是你的工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.28,0:36:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是因为如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他比想象的还单纯  难办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经开始诉苦了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.71,0:36:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你自己吹着要把他接过去的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.55,0:36:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  确实以真嗣君的性格  可能不太容易交到朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.70,0:36:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道“豪猪的窘境”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豪猪？那个浑身带刺的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.79,0:36:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豪猪虽然想向对方传达自己的温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是越是靠近  越是因为身上的刺而使彼此受到伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.38,0:36:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同样也适用于人类
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.10,0:37:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的真嗣君  心中某处害怕受到这种伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.43,0:37:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才会变得胆小懦弱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.39,0:37:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.93,0:37:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.32,0:37:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正  自然而然就会发觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.78,0:37:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓的成长  就是不断重复地靠近与分离
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到找出彼此都不易受伤的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.18,0:37:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能那样就最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.07,0:37:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来  这B栋的设备改造维修预算什么时候才能批下来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.92,0:37:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA的维护和兵器装备相关项目是最优先的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.21,0:37:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没钱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.44,0:37:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐得屁股发凉  真不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.29,0:37:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急集合
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.63,0:37:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以光学捕捉移动物体
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.47,0:38:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,E-747也确认对象
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.57,0:38:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分析图案  蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.15,0:38:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有错  是第五使徒
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.21,0:38:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员  第一战斗配置
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.45,0:38:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  地对空迎击战  准备
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.11,0:38:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三新东京市  转入战斗形态
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中央区域  开始收容
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.36,0:39:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中央区域  以及第1至第7管区收容完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.54,0:39:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经向政府以及相关各省发出通知
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.10,0:39:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标依然在前进中
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.73,0:39:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  对空迎击系统运行率48%
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.13,0:39:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非战斗人员以及平民呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.65,0:39:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告说已经全部撤退完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中小学生以班级为单位
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.20,0:39:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位市民到指定区域集合
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.34,0:39:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第7管区的寻人中心设在323避难所
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.94,0:39:44.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.94,0:39:44.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.62,0:39:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  又是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.07,0:39:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又只有字幕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓的报道管制啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.57,0:39:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会让我们这些平民看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此重大的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.72,0:40:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是在浪费税金么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.21,0:40:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世上有很多人不消耗些弹药就下不了台
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.69,0:40:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本政府发来EVANGELION的出击请求
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.65,0:40:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群啰嗦的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.03,0:40:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不说我们也会出击的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.67,0:40:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始注入
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.50,0:40:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LCL电荷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.72,0:40:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压制锁解除
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.33,0:40:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲又没在看着  为什么还要驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.05,0:40:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要被人讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.09,0:40:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  有些话想单独跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.37,0:40:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.34,0:40:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一会儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.46,0:40:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.79,0:40:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对  然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.13,0:40:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班长
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.31,0:40:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.03,0:40:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩要去厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.16,0:40:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  快去快回
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.72,0:40:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.91,0:40:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死之前至少要看一次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.87,0:40:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说上头的战斗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.20,0:40:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是货真价实的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.57,0:40:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道敌人下次什么时候再来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.07,0:40:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健介  真服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.44,0:41:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错过这次机会可能就一辈子都…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.57,0:41:04.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了  帮我一起把锁打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.08,0:41:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  就帮你一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.37,0:41:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真是随性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.54,0:41:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  可以出击了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.49,0:41:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.59,0:41:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  一边中和敌人的A.T.立场
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.87,0:41:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边用机关枪齐射
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.51,0:41:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和练习一样  没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.80,0:41:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.59,0:41:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出击
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.36,0:41:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害  不枉我这一番辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.72,0:41:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  终于等到了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.91,0:41:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.00,0:41:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把准心对准目标  扣下扳机 - AT立场展开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.09,0:41:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.57,0:41:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.86,0:41:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按计划进行  明白吗  真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.31,0:41:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋！  烟尘四起看不到敌人了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.13,0:42:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊  一下就完蛋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.14,0:42:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.19,0:42:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出预备的步枪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.24,0:42:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.27,0:42:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君？真嗣君？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.03,0:42:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  被你揍的那下起效了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.97,0:42:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰…啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电源缆线被切断了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.66,0:43:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA  切换到内部电源
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.62,0:43:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离活动停止还剩4分53秒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.52,0:43:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这边来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.79,0:43:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  没事吧  真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.26,0:43:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,损伤如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题  还能战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.42,0:43:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣的同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.13,0:43:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会在这种地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.87,0:43:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不战斗啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.97,0:43:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们在这里  所以不能自由活动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.53,0:43:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机  距离活动停止还剩3分28秒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.10,0:43:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接触面熔解  损伤率58%
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.18,0:44:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  让他们俩进操纵席
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.53,0:44:06.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他俩收容之后暂时撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.85,0:44:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重整后再出击
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.11,0:44:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边的两人  乘上去  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.94,0:44:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  是水？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.96,0:44:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摄影机  摄影机
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.34,0:44:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接触面  第三保护层熔解
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.84,0:44:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在  撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.87,0:44:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回收路线为第34号
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.44,0:44:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向山的东侧后退
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.12,0:44:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转校生  叫你撤退呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.58,0:44:45.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转校生！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.88,0:44:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃避  不能逃避  不能逃避…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高振动粒子刀  装备
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.45,0:44:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  听从命令  撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.41,0:44:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.90,0:45:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.94,0:45:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机  距离活动停止还剩30秒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.33,0:45:29.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,28
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.39,0:45:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,27
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.36,0:45:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,26
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.42,0:45:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,25
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.32,0:45:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.28,0:45:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,23
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.26,0:45:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.79,0:45:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,13
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.77,0:45:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,12
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.66,0:45:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,11
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.68,0:45:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.49,0:45:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.53,0:45:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,8
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.63,0:45:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.71,0:45:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.69,0:45:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.60,0:45:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.62,0:45:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.70,0:45:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.66,0:45:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.39,0:46:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA初号机  活动停止
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.45,0:46:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标形态完全崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.58,0:46:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么无视我的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.50,0:46:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.13,0:46:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的作战负责人是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.16,0:46:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.06,0:46:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有义务遵从我的命令  知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.90,0:46:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.04,0:47:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后不许再有这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.69,0:47:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.48,0:47:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.81,0:47:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我知道了  美里小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.02,0:47:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么所谓  反正都赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.79,0:47:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你吩咐  我就会坐上去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.22,0:47:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我驾驶就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.21,0:47:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  你先回去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.35,0:47:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一站  长尾山顶  长尾山顶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.59,0:48:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口改为右侧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.95,0:48:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是不打算回来了啊  那个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.91,0:49:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇  碇真嗣
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.47,0:49:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么  刚转校就缺席了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.07,0:49:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  接下来发上次的试卷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.47,0:50:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你们便吧  带我回美里小姐那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.66,0:50:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去转了下  心情好点了吗  碇真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.72,0:51:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么  一切都无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.56,0:51:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经没有自由可言了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.50,0:51:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我只能驾驶EVA
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.82,0:51:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲就是为此才叫我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.41,0:51:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  我会驾驶的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.10,0:51:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样对大家都有好处的话  我也不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.31,0:51:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家？那你自己怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.30,0:51:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我自己做不来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.31,0:51:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也一定都清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.67,0:51:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管如此  受伤的绫波  美里小姐还有父亲都…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.67,0:51:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要闹到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.04,0:51:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟别人没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.21,0:51:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是否继续做EVA的驾驶员  由你自己来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.70,0:51:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愿意的话离开这里也行
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.65,0:51:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都是你的自由  你爱怎样就怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.13,0:51:59.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果  你儿子采取的行动如预料的一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.65,0:52:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  接下来让他与丽再接近一些
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.63,0:52:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划不变
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.52,0:52:08.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,14年前就写好的剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.97,0:52:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被命运所束缚的孩子们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.25,0:52:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太残酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.57,0:52:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.93,0:52:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行啦  快动手
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.65,0:52:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不这样的话  我无法原谅自己
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.30,0:52:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢  他就是这样的直肠子  拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.95,0:52:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我们就扯平了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.90,0:52:41.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次揍了你  对不起  碇
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.20,0:52:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲啊  佳代子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.73,0:52:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许输
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.35,0:52:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输了就请我吃披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.96,0:52:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  冲
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.02,0:53:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.90,0:53:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  再给我一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.75,0:53:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌  男生在看着这边
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.82,0:53:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,H
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.59,0:53:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.44,0:53:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉铃原眼神好猥琐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.70,0:53:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇君！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.31,0:53:14.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波丽  14岁
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.61,0:53:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据马鲁杜克的报告书选出来的第一适格者  第一名少女
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.40,0:53:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是EVANGELION试作零号机的专属操纵者
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.98,0:53:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的经历如一张白纸  全部被消除了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.90,0:53:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了救那个绫波  父亲他…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.97,0:53:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动系统发生异常
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.76,0:53:37.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三阶段也出现问题
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.44,0:53:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中枢神经粒子开始从内部拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.93,0:53:41.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主传导系统交扰  流动中
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.83,0:53:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脉冲逆流  无法停止
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.45,0:53:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 直通监视器断线 - 主传导系统交扰  流动中
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.73,0:53:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.61,0:53:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入栓深度不稳定  被吸入EVA里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.78,0:53:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止接触  六号为止的回路紧急关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.99,0:53:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  信号无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.78,0:53:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零号机  无法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.43,0:54:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中止实验  拔掉电源
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.68,0:54:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.63,0:54:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零号机  切换到预备电源
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.85,0:54:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离完全停止还有35秒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.20,0:54:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动控制系统  还未能启动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.68,0:54:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太危险了  请退后
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.27,0:54:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动弹出装置启动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.12,0:54:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.16,0:54:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零号机依然无法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.60,0:54:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊贝克莱特酚醛树脂  赶快
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.51,0:54:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.94,0:54:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离完全停止还有10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.69,0:54:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,8
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.62,0:54:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.58,0:54:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.66,0:54:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.59,0:54:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.54,0:54:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.53,0:54:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.59,0:54:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.83,0:54:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零号机完全停止
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.00,0:54:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.50,0:55:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽  没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.28,0:55:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.94,0:55:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.63,0:55:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一时间还真无法相信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.78,0:55:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然正规的报告书里已经删除了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.50,0:55:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但确实是无可辩驳的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.09,0:55:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让引发这起暴走事件的零号机解冻
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.84,0:55:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是太性急了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.35,0:55:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使徒再次出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.26,0:55:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,增强战斗力是我们的当务之急
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.11,0:55:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话虽如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.55,0:55:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽的再起动实验已经检查完了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.41,0:55:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零号机本体也没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.88,0:55:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神经接续调整完成的话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.46,0:55:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能立刻重新投入实战对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.12,0:56:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波  为什么总是一个人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.28,0:56:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA初号机进入第三次冷却
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.00,0:56:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第六格纳库内直到第三阶段的各系统关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.09,0:56:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入栓的个人信息全部拷贝到MELCHIORL
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.14,0:56:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.57,0:56:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 了解  连接回路 - 开始数据传送
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.32,0:56:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三次冷却开始
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.22,0:56:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Casper的状况复制到MELCHIORL
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.25,0:56:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在初号机的插入栓深度是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.07,0:56:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零点八  测量误差在允许范围内
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.79,0:56:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离重新进行零号机的传导实验还有150分
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.61,0:56:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  定时同步测试  第508程序结束
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.95,0:56:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.11,0:56:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟他一起  生活的怎样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.21,0:56:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还行吧  稍微习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.29,0:56:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还会紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.78,0:56:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是第一次和男人一起生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.09,0:56:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和八年前不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.50,0:56:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次不是谈恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.26,0:56:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.99,0:57:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君是因为你才留下来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.35,0:57:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.62,0:57:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是因为父亲在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.55,0:57:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让父亲看着自己  了解自己  接触自己
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.28,0:57:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕一句也行  希望能得到夸奖
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.55,0:57:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许只是想得到一份不让自己感到孤独的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.01,0:57:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与父亲不和
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.87,0:57:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟美里你一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.56,0:57:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇司令为什么对自己的亲儿子这么漠不关心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.24,0:57:31.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和丽却挺健谈的  不太平衡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.93,0:57:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的男人都只在乎自己
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.98,0:57:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的时代女人变得不好过了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.47,0:57:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.11,0:57:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到  得回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.47,0:57:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是老样子  整一个工作狂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.12,0:57:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美里  回去的时候  把这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.66,0:57:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君正式的保安卡还有绫波丽的更新卡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.01,0:57:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才忘记交给他们俩了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.10,0:57:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天  能拜托真嗣君吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.16,0:58:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.59,0:58:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波丽
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.20,0:58:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲为什么对她笑
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.78,0:58:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却为什么不对我笑
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.70,0:58:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.24,0:58:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了  我是碇
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.61,0:58:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波  我进来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.60,0:59:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是绫波的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.90,0:59:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的…这个
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.43,0:59:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是要…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.95,1:00:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让一下吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.87,1:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.50,1:00:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎…其实！！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.13,1:00:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.17,1:00:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  那…那个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.43,1:00:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  我…那个…这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.37,1:01:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受…受人所托  就是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.00,1:01:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么来着
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.35,1:01:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡…卡更新了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.43,1:01:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我送过来…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.03,1:01:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…所以
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.19,1:01:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不是想…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.55,1:01:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,律子小姐说忘记给你了…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.75,1:01:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的  然后我按门铃也没人来开门
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.45,1:01:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门没上锁我就…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.82,1:01:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中央大门现在开放中
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.68,1:01:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三小组请使用第4直通口
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.02,1:02:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是绫波的新卡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.36,1:02:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,律子小姐拜托我的…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.86,1:02:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚对不起了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.86,1:02:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.53,1:02:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说  绫波你不害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.83,1:02:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要驾驶那个EVANGELION
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.38,1:02:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.65,1:02:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说在上次的实验中受了很重的伤…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.11,1:02:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此…真的…没关系吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.97,1:02:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.72,1:02:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…或许什么时候又会暴走而遇到危险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.26,1:02:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又或者败给使徒  我们也可能会被杀哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.24,1:02:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是碇司令的儿子吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.52,1:02:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.63,1:02:55.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不信任你父亲的工作吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.97,1:02:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不相信了  那种父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.32,1:03:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.26,1:03:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,监视对象侵入小田原防卫线
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.00,1:03:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未确认飞行物体的分析完成
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.15,1:03:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,图像为蓝色  确认是使徒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.38,1:03:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是第六使徒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.91,1:03:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  让初号机出击
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.27,1:03:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA初号机  准备出击
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.99,1:03:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切换为对空迎击武器
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.40,1:03:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标侵入芦之湖上空
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.53,1:03:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA初号机  完成出击准备
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.64,1:03:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出击
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.80,1:04:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标内部发现高能量反应
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.53,1:04:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.41,1:04:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.32,1:04:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲开！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.30,1:04:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.65,1:04:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同步率下降到极低水平
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.49,1:04:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展开防护装甲
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.88,1:04:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止迎击  EVA初号机  紧急回收！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.52,1:04:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.21,1:04:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹射器熔解  无法启动
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.20,1:04:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A.T.力场呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.23,1:05:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经展开到极限了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勉强还能维持形状
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.11,1:05:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！不要啊！让我出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.53,1:05:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我出去！父亲！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.38,1:05:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃作战大纲  优先保护驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.77,1:05:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入栓  紧急射出
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.63,1:05:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.23,1:05:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在失去驾驶员的话
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.86,1:05:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA的A.T.力场就会完全消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.22,1:05:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是最该担心的事态
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.16,1:05:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.12,1:05:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.61,1:05:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机体强制回收
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.20,1:05:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点火炸掉螺栓
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.53,1:06:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标停止攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.22,1:06:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机回收到99机库
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.53,1:06:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救护班  待机
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.80,1:06:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优先进行插入栓的LCL冷却
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.20,1:06:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶员已确认  心跳微弱
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.94,1:06:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗服的生命维持机能开到最大
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.07,1:06:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,施行心脏按摩
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.27,1:06:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.73,1:06:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脉冲确认
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.98,1:06:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入栓强制排出
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.12,1:06:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内核固定在可以离合的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.21,1:06:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LCL紧急排水
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.65,1:06:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.09,1:06:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LCL  排水中
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.75,1:06:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧进行救护处理
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.90,1:07:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在目标从我们正上方开始侵占
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.62,1:07:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲着地下空间钻孔中
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.73,1:07:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那厮的目的是对这NERV本部直接攻击吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.93,1:07:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各部门向我报告分析结果
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.80,1:07:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据刚才的战斗数据推测
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.28,1:07:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标会自动清除一定距离内的外敌
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.69,1:07:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说用EVA进行接近战是不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.91,1:07:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A.T.力场怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.41,1:07:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健在  加上相位模式经常变化
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.63,1:07:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外形也不稳定  中和工作相当困难
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.40,1:07:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据MAGI的计算
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.24,1:07:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要用N2航空暴雷的攻击方法贯穿目标的A.T.力场
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.39,1:07:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要使用连NERV本部一起破坏掉的分量
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.28,1:07:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松代的MAGI2号得出同样的结论
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.96,1:08:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在日本政府与联合国军提倡将NERV总部整个进行自爆攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.54,1:08:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隔岸观火的人还真敢说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.67,1:08:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是失去这里一切都完了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.23,1:08:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  麻烦的前端部位已经通过装甲复合带第2层
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.74,1:08:14.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经侵入到第3层了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.14,1:08:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贯穿目前建筑的全部22层Kakmo式装甲带
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.54,1:08:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到达本部上方的预定时间是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.92,1:08:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天凌晨0点06分54秒
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.13,1:08:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10小时14分之后
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.43,1:08:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加上零号机还没有调整  实战是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.69,1:08:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机也因为刚才的损伤暂时无法正常运作
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.79,1:08:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,状况不容乐观啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.44,1:08:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就是四面楚歌
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.81,1:08:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要举白旗吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.22,1:08:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…不过在那之前还有事情想做
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.15,1:08:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得谍报部里有战自研的极密资料  是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.75,1:09:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…你又制定出胡来的作战计划了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.18,1:09:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛城作战部长
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.39,1:09:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说胡来也太失礼了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.09,1:09:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是在剩下9小时可能实现的  而且是最实际的作战哦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.80,1:09:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八岛作战
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.65,1:09:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如其名  从日本全国接收电力
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.80,1:09:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强制发动战自研极密试作开发中的大功率阳电子自走炮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.38,1:09:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于还未完成  不能自行调整的部分由EVA来进行精密狙击
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.31,1:09:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联合国军暂且不说  亏你能把内务省和战略自卫队都给说服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么说  我还是有不少关系的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.17,1:09:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行内知内幕嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.71,1:10:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚  凌晨0点开始到黎明时分全国将有大规模停电
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.50,1:10:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬请各位配合  重复一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.96,1:10:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凌晨0点开始到黎明时分全国将有大规模停电
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.98,1:10:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 敬请各位配合 - 那么  走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.46,1:10:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.93,1:10:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.45,1:10:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚  凌晨0点开始到黎明时分全国将有大规模停电
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.21,1:10:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬请各位配合
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.96,1:10:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使徒的前端部位突破第7装甲板
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.26,1:10:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源系统的估算呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.88,1:10:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电力系统由新御殿场变电站和两所后备处直接供电
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.74,1:11:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  引流用超传导电缆向下二子山铺设中
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.49,1:11:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括变压系统在内  预定今天22点50分全线通电
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.40,1:11:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙击系统的进展情况呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.18,1:11:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,组装工作没问题  会想办法在作战开始前完成的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.36,1:11:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA初号机的状况如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.10,1:11:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  正在装换狙击专用的G型装备
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.59,1:11:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有两小时成型
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.70,1:11:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  接下来就是驾驶员的问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.29,1:11:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他…还愿意来驾驶吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.19,1:11:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算如何处置初号机驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.53,1:11:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Dummy插入系统还在试验运用前阶段
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.84,1:11:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在实用化之前就使用现在的驾驶员吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.08,1:11:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最坏的打算  洗脑吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.50,1:11:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的话大不了让丽出击
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.03,1:11:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让丽用初号机…太危险了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.11,1:11:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管用什么手段  我们还必须打倒八个使徒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.47,1:12:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它的事以后再说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.74,1:12:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要驾驶EVA
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.67,1:12:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺利的话就是理所当然  所以谁也不夸奖我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.45,1:12:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失败的话就要被大家讨厌  自己孤独的死去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.64,1:12:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要留在这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.14,1:12:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想着可能会有什么改变  或者会遇到什么好事才到这来的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.04,1:12:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是为了留下痛苦的回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.38,1:12:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想就这样一直逃避讨厌的事情生活下去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.08,1:12:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活着？我为什么会活着？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.57,1:12:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活着不是迫不得已的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.78,1:12:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲也好  美里小姐也好  没人需要我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.62,1:12:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能驾驶EVA的我不需要
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.28,1:12:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我只能驾驶EVA
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.86,1:13:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才能留在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.83,1:13:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  一旦坐上EVA…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.91,1:13:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是同样的天花板
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.58,1:13:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦驾驶EVA就总是这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.10,1:13:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.17,1:13:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都在这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.50,1:13:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来传达明天凌晨0点发动的八岛作战的安排
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.00,1:13:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇  绫波两名驾驶员于本日19点30分在第二终点站集合
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.09,1:13:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20点整  初号机移动开始  零号机跟随
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.23,1:13:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20点05  出击  同时30分  到达二子山第二要塞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.91,1:13:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后待机等待其它命令
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.86,1:13:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天0时  开始作战行动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.26,1:13:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饭
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.21,1:14:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么也不想吃
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.34,1:14:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,90分钟后就出发哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.96,1:14:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要驾驶那个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.46,1:14:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.53,1:14:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够了  再也不想体会那种可怕的回忆了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.82,1:14:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很害怕…很害怕…可是又不能逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.26,1:14:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕EVA吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.93,1:14:21.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  睡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.99,1:14:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我睡？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.55,1:14:26.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来驾驶初号机
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.27,1:14:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.16,1:14:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.74,1:14:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人前端部位  突破第17装甲带
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.12,1:14:54.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离到达NERV本部还有4小时55分
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.14,1:14:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西箱根新线以及南塔山谷的架空三号线通电完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.68,1:15:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  第16Bank变电设备的设置工作还在继续
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.92,1:15:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,50万伏特通常变压器的设置时间按照计划时间不变
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.52,1:15:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第28变压器群延迟5分钟到达
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.96,1:15:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,负责人抓紧各结线工作
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.50,1:15:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四次先行模拟开始  修复支援系统重新确认中
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.82,1:15:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全SMES的设置完成  依次开展第一集束系统动作确认
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.20,1:15:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全超传导超超高压最终变压器集群的开闭检查完成  无异常
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.32,1:15:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是大型试作阳电子炮吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.01,1:15:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然是赶工出来的  设计理论上没有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.60,1:15:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到0点整我们就强制把它和G型装备连接
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.76,1:15:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就靠你了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.46,1:15:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终要靠的还是驾驶员呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.53,1:16:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美里  要是顺利就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.88,1:16:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  集合时间早已经就过了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.35,1:16:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是自己决定留在这里的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.42,1:16:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就把自己的工作做好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.50,1:16:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很怕驾驶EVA啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.44,1:16:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美里小姐你们真好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.05,1:16:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是留在安全的地下本部发号施令
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.67,1:16:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽是让我去冒险
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.84,1:16:34.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美里小姐你们太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.70,1:16:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.10,1:16:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十五年前  第二次冲击使半数的人类灭亡
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.33,1:17:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是现在使徒引发第三次冲击的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.21,1:17:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类这次就要灭亡了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不剩
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.36,1:17:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些话  我听过很多遍了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.73,1:17:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们NERV总部设定为要是等级EEE被使徒侵入  就会自动自爆
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.12,1:17:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使与使徒同归于尽  也要防止第三次冲击
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.23,1:17:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都是抱着这种觉悟在这工作的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.79,1:17:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.13,1:17:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.08,1:17:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EVA？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.10,1:18:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  是这颗星球生命的起源与结束的关键
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.91,1:18:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二使徒  莉莉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.34,1:18:06.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉莉丝？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.68,1:18:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  可以说是第三次冲击的诱因
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.47,1:18:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护莉莉丝  用EVA战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.25,1:18:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是只有你才能做到的事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.09,1:18:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把人类的未来托付给了你和EVA
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.24,1:18:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么艰辛的任务…为什么要我来做
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.47,1:18:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么理由  只是命运选择了你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.35,1:18:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  真嗣君你并不是一个人在战斗的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.98,1:18:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家会跟你一起面对
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.98,1:18:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再驾驶一次看看
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.69,1:19:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  传令给本次作战的各负责人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.38,1:19:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.44,1:19:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.28,1:19:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机担任炮手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.35,1:19:09.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.33,1:19:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽驾驶零号机负责防御
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.17,1:19:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.42,1:19:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次要求高精度的操作
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.28,1:19:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  比起未调整的零号机
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.55,1:19:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使在修复中也还是初号机更有利
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.87,1:19:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  真嗣君  阳电子受地球自转  磁场  重力的影响
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.89,1:19:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是直线前进的  别忘了修正误差
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.40,1:19:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须准确地贯穿核心的一点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.54,1:19:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不知道哪里是核心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.32,1:19:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.61,1:19:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标内部有个只在攻击形态才实体化的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.00,1:19:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们推测那就是核心
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.46,1:19:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙击位置的指定  射击诱导的各项数据全部由我们来输入
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.99,1:19:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要跟练习时一样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.84,1:20:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后在正中心的标志对准的时候按下按钮就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.40,1:20:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后就交给机器来处理
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.20,1:20:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  狙击用大电力的最终放电收束点只有一点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.31,1:20:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此初号机不能离开狙击位置
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.19,1:20:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说逃不了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.15,1:20:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.22,1:20:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  要是打偏了  敌人反击时怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.49,1:20:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不要想那么多  只要考虑一击击破就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.03,1:20:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就很危险了是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.06,1:20:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我只要保护初号机就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.08,1:20:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.97,1:20:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.64,1:20:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时间了  你们俩去换衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.33,1:20:40.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.81,1:20:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.57,1:20:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次…说不定会死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.59,1:20:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.81,1:21:01.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.35,1:21:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会保护你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.05,1:21:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有被保护的价值
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.88,1:21:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本部宣传部传来的口信
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.42,1:21:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  我是铃原
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.42,1:21:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇  不  让我叫你真嗣吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.25,1:21:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣  拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.36,1:21:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是相田  碇  加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.31,1:22:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波为什么要驾驶EVA呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.43,1:22:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为羁绊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.36,1:22:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羁绊？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.10,1:22:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  羁绊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.06,1:22:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与父亲的？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.29,1:22:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与大家的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.64,1:22:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真坚强啊  绫波
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.82,1:22:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此以外  我就一无所有了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.95,1:22:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了  走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.29,1:22:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通知  现在是凌晨0点
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.40,1:23:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.48,1:23:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.01,1:23:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光是愿意驾驶EVA  我就很感激了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.03,1:23:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.71,1:23:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八岛作战开始  阳电子炮狙击准备
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.35,1:23:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次连接开始
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.07,1:23:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  各部门切换至第一第二变电站系统
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.98,1:23:35.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投入全断续器  开始连接
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.64,1:23:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各发电设备维持全力运转  离输出界限还有0.7
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.93,1:23:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电力供给系统无异常
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.96,1:23:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周波数变换容量  增大到6500万kw
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.22,1:23:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有变压装置无异常
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.00,1:23:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一隔离系统按顺次运作中
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.79,1:23:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开第1到第803管区送电回路
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.00,1:23:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电压稳定  系统波数维持在50赫兹
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.43,1:23:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二次连接
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.38,1:24:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新御殿场变电站  开始投入
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.60,1:24:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新裾野变电站  开始投入
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.44,1:24:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来  新汤河原预备变电站  开始投入
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.42,1:24:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电压变动幅度没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.32,1:24:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三次连接
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.76,1:24:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  全部电力传到二子山增设变电站
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.08,1:24:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电力电送电压维持在最高电压
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.87,1:24:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全冷却系统最大输出运转中
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.39,1:24:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超传导电力贮藏系统群  充电率78.6%
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.48,1:24:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指压器确认  无异状
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.07,1:24:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惯性轮开始回转
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.16,1:24:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自西日本的周波数变换电力维持在最大数
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.41,1:24:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三次连接  没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.65,1:24:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  传达到第四  第五要塞
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.52,1:24:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按计划开始行动  观测机立即退避
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.01,1:25:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三对地攻击系统蒸发
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.02,1:25:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了  别给它时间  继续
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.85,1:25:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第2炮台  中弹
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.01,1:25:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第8VLS群  蒸发
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.66,1:25:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第4对地系统攻击开始
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.66,1:25:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第6导弹阵地  被毁
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.06,1:25:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,激光炮射群  第3波  发射
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.55,1:25:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续  第7炮台  开始攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.17,1:25:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳电子加速器积蓄中  +1兆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.14,1:25:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收束回转数维持在3万8千
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.62,1:25:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压缩密度向发射点上升中
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.82,1:25:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送电损失增大
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.35,1:25:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电压运运变率达到0.019%
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.04,1:25:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切断事故回路
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.90,1:25:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转换  快点
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.97,1:25:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电力低下在允许数值内
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.17,1:25:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统保护回路运作中  修复运转开始
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.94,1:25:57.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四次连接  没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.80,1:25:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终安全装置  解除
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.81,1:26:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上膛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.95,1:26:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射击用各数据  最终输入开始
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.78,1:26:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球自转及重力的误差修正+0.0009
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.14,1:26:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射击准星正在自动追踪目标
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.21,1:26:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄准器  调整完成
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.12,1:26:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳电子加速中  离发射点还有0.2…0.1
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.40,1:26:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第五次最终连接
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.42,1:26:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全能量传到超高电压放电系统
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.17,1:26:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第1至第9放电插头  受电准备完成
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.97,1:26:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳电子加速管  最终补正
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.14,1:26:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脉冲稳定  没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.77,1:26:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有绫波那样的觉悟  也没有熟练操作EVA的自信
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.40,1:26:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道理由  只是让它动起来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.65,1:26:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护人类…这种没有实在感的重要事情
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.62,1:26:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要我来做？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.10,1:26:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,13
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.97,1:26:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,12
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.92,1:26:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,11
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.02,1:26:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.90,1:26:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.87,1:27:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,8
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.92,1:27:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.97,1:27:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.94,1:27:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.88,1:27:04.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.88,1:27:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.93,1:27:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.01,1:27:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.13,1:27:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.27,1:27:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.02,1:27:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打偏了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.77,1:27:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会  偏偏在这个时候？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.33,1:27:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标出现高能量反应！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.15,1:27:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员  准备承受直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.66,1:28:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能量系统怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.87,1:28:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能用  已经开始重新充电了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.54,1:28:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳电子炮呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.91,1:28:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,健在  现在炮身冷却中
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.88,1:28:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不知道能不能再开一枪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.62,1:28:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用确认  只能一试了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.00,1:28:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君  没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.31,1:28:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧让初号机返回到狙击地点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.53,1:28:40.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.18,1:28:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在更换初号机的驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.58,1:28:56.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙击手由零号机驾驶员来担当
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.84,1:28:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.21,1:29:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能用了就只能丢掉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.81,1:29:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.15,1:29:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没有逃避而选择了驾驶EVA
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.80,1:29:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要不是他自己要求下来  就应把此重任托付给他
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.15,1:29:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣  拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.19,1:29:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇  加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.38,1:29:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您相信自己的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.43,1:29:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也相信初号机的驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.48,1:29:50.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给你了  随你调度吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.83,1:29:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.23,1:29:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.33,1:29:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.69,1:30:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在再次把全日本的能源和我们的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.93,1:30:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的未来  幸存下来的所有生命
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都托付给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.48,1:30:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.32,1:30:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.69,1:30:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固定枪身位置
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.97,1:30:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放电系统重新调整
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.35,1:30:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初号机废弃G型装备
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.54,1:30:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由射击最终系统切换到手动模式
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.06,1:30:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人前端部位  到达本部正上方0地点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.65,1:30:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二发  快点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.75,1:30:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替换保险丝  炮身冷却结束
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.29,1:30:38.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送电系统  维持最大输出
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.78,1:30:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地上工作人员  退避完成
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.28,1:30:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各放电插头  没有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.08,1:30:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射击用数据  再输入完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.51,1:30:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后的误差修正交给驾驶员手动操作
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.83,1:30:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压力  距发射点还有0.2
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.55,1:30:54.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标再次检测到高能量反应！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.68,1:30:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.06,1:31:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真嗣君！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.20,1:31:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.56,1:31:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盾快撑不住了！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.48,1:31:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.27,1:31:26.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有20秒
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.55,1:31:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.02,1:31:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点…快点…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.85,1:31:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.76,1:32:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.46,1:32:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.46,1:32:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.44,1:33:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.69,1:33:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧？  绫波！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.43,1:33:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绫波！！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.01,1:33:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再说自己“除此以外一无所有了”
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.16,1:33:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分别时也不要再说“再见”这样的伤感话了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.05,1:34:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哭什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.98,1:34:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我不知道这个时候应该做出什么样的表情
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.45,1:34:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要微笑就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.27,1:34:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.38,1:34:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边的少年已经觉醒了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.55,1:34:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经进入“概括”的阶段
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.63,1:35:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  死海文书外典已经成为规章法典
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.95,1:35:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契约之时临近了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.29,1:35:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是第三位呢  你真是一点都没变啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.59,1:35:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很期待与你的相见之日哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.92,1:35:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碇真嗣君
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.45,1:35:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(待续)
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.12,1:35:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ IT'S ONLY LOVE IT'S ONLY LOVE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.95,1:35:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果只有一个愿望能实现的话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.26,1:35:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那么就让我睡在你身边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.32,1:35:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哪里都无所谓 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.64,1:35:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ BEAUTIFUL WORLD ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.87,1:36:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 毫不迷惘地凝视着你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.84,1:36:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ BEAUTIFUL BOY ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.92,1:36:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 还不知道自己的美吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.28,1:36:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ IT'S ONLY LOVE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.69,1:36:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 睡着醒着　都只沉迷少年漫画 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.97,1:36:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 难道他就不喜欢我吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.25,1:36:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 他想要什么　我不知道 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.17,1:36:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只想要脸颊上流淌着的温存的泪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.25,1:36:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 什么都不想说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.98,1:37:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只想再见一次面 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.29,1:37:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 想说的事情却不能说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.22,1:37:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 说不定是没有毅力 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.82,1:37:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 这样也无所谓 ∮
