Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.68,1:37:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 还不知道自己的美吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.06,1:37:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ IT'S ONLY LOVE ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.35,1:37:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 什么事情都试着做做看 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.62,1:38:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即使有损失 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.94,1:38:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但却能从中汲取一点经验 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.16,1:38:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 根本不需要什么报纸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.04,1:38:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 重要的事情都没有记载 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.41,1:38:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 最近状况怎么样 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.48,1:38:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果还充满干劲的话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.18,1:38:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那也挺好 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.79,1:38:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我的世界消失之前能够遇见你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.09,1:38:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让我睡在你身边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.92,1:38:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 无论在哪里都无所谓 ∮
